177
00:06:06,960 --> 00:06:07,360
Lingyu!

178
00:06:07,520 --> 00:06:08,120
Lingyu!

179
00:06:08,480 --> 00:06:09,120
You got it wrong!

180
00:06:09,400 --> 00:06:10,040
You got it wrong!

181
00:06:10,360 --> 00:06:11,560
If you spare me,

182
00:06:11,560 --> 00:06:12,560
I'll give you

183
