Now I get it.

292
00:09:25,320 --> 00:09:26,280
A few days ago,

293
00:09:26,280 --> 00:09:27,700
Lingyin Temple charged Mr. Huang

294
00:09:27,700 --> 00:09:29,040
1,600 taels.

295
00:09:29,040 --> 00:09:30,680
We might as well save his life.

296
00:09:30,680 --> 00:09:31,240
Let's go.

297
00:09:34,920 --> 00:09:36,160
Don't worry.

298
00:09:36,160 --> 00:09:37,480
Relax. With me around,

299
00:09:37,480 --> 00:09:38,800
nothing can go wrong.

300
00:09:41,880 --> 00:09:42,520
What?

301
00:09:43,320 --> 00:09:45,120
Why did you bring that monk here?

302
00:09:45,520 --> 00:09:47,040
He could ruin our plan!

303
00:09:47,280 --> 00:09:48,360
I know what I'm doing.

304
00:09:49,120 --> 00:09:50,600
That monk is incredibly powerful.

305
00:09:51,200 --> 00:09:52,680
He can spot a demon at a glance.

306
00:09:53,200 --> 00:09:54,600
I've cultivated before the Buddha

307
00:09:55,640 --> 00:09:56,880
and gained his blessing long ago.

308
00:09:57,600 --> 00:09:58,520
Someone like him

309
00:10:00,240 --> 00:10:01,800
can't see through my disguise.

310
00:10:15,520 --> 00:10:16,160
Holy Monk,

311
00:10:16,480 --> 00:10:17,840
how's my dad?

312
00:10:18,240 --> 00:10:20,600
Good thing I haven't bathed lately.

313
00:10:20,600 --> 00:10:22,320
Phew!

314
00:10:33,240 --> 00:10:33,960
Holy Monk,

315
00:10:33,960 --> 00:10:35,320
why are you feeding my dad
your body scrub?

316
00:10:35,560 --> 00:10:36,200
What?

317
00:10:36,200 --> 00:10:36,920
Hey!

318
00:10:37,160 --> 00:10:38,320
What body scrub?

319
00:10:38,440 --> 00:10:41,320
It's called the Kick-and-Stare Pill.

320
00:10:41,760 --> 00:10:42,920
It melts in your mouth,

321
00:10:43,120 --> 00:10:44,280
not in your hand.

322
00:10:46,800 --> 00:10:48,320
You just stole my whole pitch.

323
00:10:48,320 --> 00:10:49,240
What do I say now?

324
00:10:49,400 --> 00:10:50,720
Why don't you just be me?

325
00:10:50,720 --> 00:10:52,080
- No.
- No, no!

326
00:10:54,000 --> 00:10:55,640
As for my medicine,

327
00:10:55,640 --> 00:10:56,466
someone like your dad,

328
00:10:56,467 --> 00:10:58,120
who's already on his last legs,

329
00:10:58,120 --> 00:10:59,480
- it works even better.
- Yes.

330
00:10:59,480 --> 00:11:00,400
Don't worry.

331
00:11:01,520 --> 00:11:02,480
I see.

332
00:11:02,720 --> 00:11:03,920
Thank you, Holy Monk.

333
00:11:04,120 --> 00:11:05,520
- Sure.
- If you save my dad,

334
00:11:05,680 --> 00:11:06,660
the Huang family will

335
00:11:06,661 --> 00:11:07,640
reward you handsomely.

336
00:11:11,240 --> 00:11:11,720
No money!

337
00:11:13,760 --> 00:11:14,640
Not a cent!

338
00:11:15,120 --> 00:11:15,600
Oh.

339
00:11:15,600 --> 00:11:16,760
You little brat!

340
00:11:16,760 --> 00:11:17,948
Even if I had a fortune,

341
00:11:17,949 --> 00:11:18,840
you'd squander it all!

342
00:11:19,960 --> 00:11:20,680
Dad!

343
00:11:20,680 --> 00:11:21,640
You're awake!

344
00:11:21,920 --> 00:11:22,640
Are you okay?

345
00:11:25,760 --> 00:11:26,440
I'm fine.

346
00:11:26,440 --> 00:11:27,040
See?

347
00:11:29,920 --> 00:11:31,640
You rotten monk!

348
00:11:31,960 --> 00:11:33,600
You're after my money again!

349
00:11:33,600 --> 00:11:34,640
Hey! What are you doing?

350
00:11:34,640 --> 00:11:35,200
Dad!

351
00:11:35,360 --> 00:11:36,760
The Holy Monk came to save you.

352
00:11:38,760 --> 00:11:40,200
You only woke up after eating

353
00:11:40,200 --> 00:11:41,160
the dirt off his body.

354
00:11:41,160 --> 00:11:41,640
What?

355
00:11:41,720 --> 00:11:42,320
Yes.

356
00:11:45,920 --> 00:11:47,600
Don't worry.

357
00:11:47,840 --> 00:11:49,360
I won't charge you this time.

358
00:11:49,360 --> 00:11:52,400
We'll deduct it from your last offering.

359
00:11:53,200 --> 00:11:54,000
In your dreams!

360
00:11:54,000 --> 00:11:54,560
What?

361
00:11:54,960 --> 00:11:55,840
It's just dirt.

362
00:11:56,560 --> 00:11:57,520
I'll give it back to you.

363
00:11:59,680 --> 00:12:00,960
You swindled me out of 1,600.

364
00:12:01,400 --> 00:12:02,160
Ah.

365
00:12:02,760 --> 00:12:04,280
I want every cent back.

366
00:12:05,160 --> 00:12:05,680
Here,

367
00:12:06,080 --> 00:12:06,640
take it!

368
00:12:07,160 --> 00:12:07,960
Whoa!

369
00:12:09,840 --> 00:12:11,840
How long has it been since you bathed?

370
00:12:13,360 --> 00:12:14,280
Water costs money.

371
00:12:14,400 --> 00:12:16,520
You're such a cheapskate!

372
00:12:16,640 --> 00:12:18,360
We shouldn't have saved you.

373
00:12:18,360 --> 00:12:19,000
Exactly.

374
00:12:19,560 --> 00:12:20,760
Who asked you to meddle?

375
00:12:21,040 --> 00:12:22,040
Every extra day I lie here

376
00:12:22,520 --> 00:12:23,880
saves me a day's food.

377
00:12:24,200 --> 00:12:24,920
Oh, really?

378
00:12:25,200 --> 00:12:26,500
Want me to make sure

379
00:12:26,500 --> 00:12:28,200
you stay in bed?

380
00:12:28,400 --> 00:12:30,960
- Hey!
- Amitayus Buddha.

381
00:12:36,040 --> 00:12:37,840
What brings you here, Taoist?

382
00:12:38,000 --> 00:12:38,840
As a Taoist,

383
00:12:39,400 --> 00:12:40,560
I wander far and wide.

384
00:12:40,560 --> 00:12:41,680
I happened to pass by.

385
00:12:41,680 --> 00:12:43,080
I saw an injustice,

386
00:12:43,560 --> 00:12:45,040
so I came to help.

387
00:12:45,040 --> 00:12:46,520
I can handle this myself.

388
00:12:46,520 --> 00:12:47,560
No need to trouble yourself.

389
00:12:47,560 --> 00:12:48,000
Hey.

390
00:12:48,000 --> 00:12:48,640
Wait.

391
00:12:49,320 --> 00:12:50,760
You're a monk yourself,

392
00:12:50,920 --> 00:12:52,600
yet you're blinded by greed.

393
00:12:53,000 --> 00:12:54,040
You're using sorcery

394
00:12:54,280 --> 00:12:55,160
to scam people.

395
00:12:55,160 --> 00:12:56,680
- Me?
- Him?

396
00:12:56,680 --> 00:12:57,320
Huh?

397
00:12:57,840 --> 00:12:58,480
That's right.

398
00:12:58,600 --> 00:12:59,560
It was this monk.

399
00:12:59,720 --> 00:13:01,640
He used sorcery to show your worst fear.

400
00:13:01,760 --> 00:13:02,320
Oh.

401
00:13:02,320 --> 00:13:04,160
That's why a spell knocked you out.

402
00:13:04,160 --> 00:13:04,600
What...

403
00:13:04,840 --> 00:13:05,640
Oh.

404
00:13:05,640 --> 00:13:06,640
You rotten monk!

405
00:13:07,080 --> 00:13:08,040
Well? What do you say?

406
00:13:08,160 --> 00:13:08,720
Hey!

407
00:13:08,720 --> 00:13:09,960
We've never even met.

408
00:13:09,960 --> 00:13:11,080
Don't make things up!

409
00:13:16,360 --> 00:13:19,270
♪My shoes are worn, my hat is torn♪

410
00:13:19,720 --> 00:13:22,530
♪Even my monk's robe is tattered♪

411
00:13:22,680 --> 00:13:26,330
♪Everything I own is worn and
weathered♪

412
00:13:26,380 --> 00:13:29,360
♪Yet I laugh and live free as can be♪

413
00:13:29,820 --> 00:13:36,570
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

414
00:13:36,590 --> 00:13:40,120
♪With Buddha dwelling in my heart♪

415
00:13:46,830 --> 00:13:50,030
♪Once, I was known as Li Xiuyuan♪

416
00:13:50,060 --> 00:13:53,290
♪Now I bear the name Ji Dian♪

417
00:13:53,580 --> 00:13:56,600
♪After the wedding, I became an
immortal♪

418
00:13:56,610 --> 00:13:58,290
♪I thought of the Arhat who subdued the
tiger♪

419
00:13:58,330 --> 00:14:00,210
♪And there he was, right by my side, oh
my♪

420
00:14:00,250 --> 00:14:01,770
♪I left my wife behind♪

421
00:14:01,910 --> 00:14:03,370
♪And headed straight to Lingyin Temple♪

422
00:14:03,410 --> 00:14:07,190
♪Living a life of hiding here and
running there♪

423
00:14:07,250 --> 00:14:08,330
♪As long as thunder doesn't strike♪

424
00:14:08,340 --> 00:14:10,430
♪I still dare to make a solemn vow♪

425
00:14:10,470 --> 00:14:12,130
♪With me around, nothing can go wrong♪

426
00:14:12,170 --> 00:14:14,000
♪Waiter, bring me a plate of chicken
wings♪

427
00:14:14,030 --> 00:14:17,360
♪People laugh and say I'm lost and
foolish♪

428
00:14:17,400 --> 00:14:20,630
♪Guangliang always nags and scolds me♪

429
00:14:20,880 --> 00:14:23,760
♪His endless lectures come from worry
I'll cause trouble♪

430
00:14:23,780 --> 00:14:27,130
♪I say Buddha lives within my heart♪

431
00:14:27,180 --> 00:14:30,790
♪Wine and meat may pass through my body♪

432
00:14:30,840 --> 00:14:34,140
♪I wander around, I stroll along♪

433
00:14:34,180 --> 00:14:37,250
♪Leaving all my worries behind♪

434
00:14:37,830 --> 00:14:40,880
♪Take a sip, take a bite♪

435
00:14:40,900 --> 00:14:44,320
♪I don't overthink this life of mine♪

436
00:14:44,360 --> 00:14:47,880
♪You chase fame and fight over fortune
and fate♪

437
00:14:47,900 --> 00:14:51,360
♪You're just wasting your time♪

438
00:14:51,410 --> 00:14:54,330
♪They all call me a Living Buddha♪

439
00:14:54,380 --> 00:14:55,990
♪And I just laugh happily♪

440
00:14:56,020 --> 00:14:59,400
♪Wishing joy and happiness for all in
this world♪

441
00:15:08,120 --> 00:15:11,680
♪People laugh and say I'm lost and
foolish♪

442
00:15:11,730 --> 00:15:15,080
♪Guangliang always nags and scolds me♪

443
00:15:15,110 --> 00:15:18,090
♪His endless lectures come from worry
I'll cause trouble♪

444
